Eclipse AASX Package Explorer
-----------------------------

Parts of this project are Python ports of source code from the Eclipse AASX
Package Explorer (https://github.com/eclipse-aaspe/package-explorer), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its copyright holders include Festo AG &
Co. KG, PHOENIX CONTACT GmbH & Co. KG, Fraunhofer IOSB-INA, Schneider Electric
Automation GmbH, SICK AG, KEB Automation KG and Lenze SE; see that project's
NOTICE.md and src/LICENSE.txt.

The ported code was translated from C# to Python and modified. Ported modules:

- src/excel_to_aasx/domain/importing/ (ImportPopulateByTable, "Import NAMUR
  SMTs" table preset)
- src/excel_to_aasx/domain/ids.py (IriIrdiRemoveVersion)
- src/excel_to_aasx/domain/document/ (ExportSmt, ExportTableProcessor, the
  "Submodel template spec - AsciiDoc" table preset, Uml/PlantUmlWriter)
- src/excel_to_aasx/adapters/aasx/table_model.py
  (FindConceptDescriptionByReference)

docs/spec/namur-import.md and docs/spec/asciidoc-export.md name the C# source
files and mark which behaviour reproduces them.

